        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.88fr_1.12fr] lg:items-center">
        <div data-reveal="soft">
          <h3 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
